# {App Name} Deployment Guide

Generated: {timestamp}

## Quick Start

```bash
# Build image
./docker/build.sh

# Start services
cd docker && docker-compose up -d

# Check status
docker-compose ps
docker-compose logs -f
```

## Configuration

| Setting | Default | Description |
| ------- | ------- | ----------- |
| Port | {port} | Exposed port |
| Data dir | /app/data | Persistent data |
| Log dir | /data/logs | Host log path |

## Notes

- Adjust volume mount paths in `docker-compose.yml` to match your host environment
- Sensitive configuration is injected via environment variables, never committed to the repository
